# Suggested-prompt dev sets contain raw archive text (private).
evals/suggested_prompt/*.jsonl

# Skill runtime state belongs in the agent workspace, not the git checkout.
# contrib/skills/*/fetch.sh resolve their state dir as
# `${DECAFCLAW_WORKSPACE:-$PWD}/skill-state/<skill>`, and the shell tools only
# inject DECAFCLAW_WORKSPACE (src/decafclaw/tools/shell_tools.py). Run one of
# those scripts any other way with a cwd inside the checkout and the $PWD
# fallback wins, leaving last-run-time.txt in the worktree. Ignoring the path
# keeps a stray run from dirtying the tree; it does not change where state is
# written when DECAFCLAW_WORKSPACE is set.
contrib/skills/*/skill-state/
